> Module Art_068_a

# Código do IRS

## Capítulo III: Taxas

### Artigo 68.º-A: Taxa adicional de solidariedade

Sources: [AT, artigo 68.º-A](https://info.portaldasfinancas.gov.pt/pt/informacao_fiscal/codigos_tributarios/cirs_rep/Pages/irs68a.aspx)
and [Lei n.º 7-A/2016, de 30 de março](https://info.portaldasfinancas.gov.pt/pt/informacao_fiscal/legislacao/diplomas_legislativos/Documents/Lei_7_A_2016.pdf).
The AT amendment history lists March 2016 as the last amendment; this is the
wording applicable to 2025. N.º 3 and the revocations below reflect that law.

Supply taxable income, after category deductions, not gross income. For joint
filing this is the full household amount (e.g. the output of art. 22), NOT the
quotient already calculated by art. 69. `tributacao_conjunta` attests a valid
joint-filing election; false selects individual/separate taxation. Eligibility
and allocation to the return remain caller responsibilities. This scope covers
the ordinary resident A/H regime, not special regimes or exempt income that
must be included to determine the rate.

The output `imposto` is ONLY the solidarity surcharge. Add it to the general-rate
coleta from art. 68 or 69; it is not a replacement for those articles, nor the
final tax payable after all adjustments and credits.

Rounding convention (provisional, as in art. 69): round the joint quotient to
cents, calculate the two tax portions with exact decimal arithmetic, round their
sum once to cents, then double for joint filing. Catala rounds half away from
zero. The law does not specify these intermediate rounding steps; see PLAN.md
for the outstanding AT comparison. Tests pin this convention, not AT behaviour.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope TaxaSolidariedade:
  input ano content integer
  input rendimento_coletavel content money
  input tributacao_conjunta condition
  internal limite_inferior content money
  internal limite_superior content money
  internal taxa_inferior content decimal
  internal taxa_superior content decimal
  internal imposto_quociente content money
  output quociente content money
  output imposto content money
```

#### N.º 1

1 - Sem prejuízo do disposto no artigo 68.º, ao quantitativo do rendimento
coletável superior a (euro) 80 000 incidem as taxas adicionais de solidariedade
constantes da tabela seguinte:

| Rendimento coletável (euros) | Taxa (percentagem) |
|-----------------------------|-------------------|
| De mais de 80 000 até 250 000 | 2,5 |
| Superior a 250 000 | 5 |

```catala
scope TaxaSolidariedade:
  assertion (ano = 2025)
  assertion (rendimento_coletavel >= $0)

  definition limite_inferior under condition ano = 2025
    consequence equals $80,000
  definition limite_superior under condition ano = 2025
    consequence equals $250,000
  definition taxa_inferior under condition ano = 2025
    consequence equals 2.5%
  definition taxa_superior under condition ano = 2025
    consequence equals 5%

  definition imposto_quociente under condition quociente <= limite_inferior
    consequence equals $0

  definition imposto_quociente
    under condition quociente > limite_inferior and quociente <= limite_superior
    consequence equals
      money of ((decimal of (quociente - limite_inferior)) * taxa_inferior)
```

#### N.º 2

2 - O quantitativo da parte do rendimento coletável que exceda (euro) 80 000,
quando superior a (euro) 250 000, é dividido em duas partes: uma, igual a
(euro) 170 000, à qual se aplica a taxa de 2,5 %; outra, igual ao rendimento
coletável que exceda (euro) 250 000, à qual se aplica a taxa de 5 %.

Note: the €250,000 threshold applies to taxable income, consistent with the
table and the explicit second portion, not to income minus €80,000. The first
portion is €250,000 − €80,000 = €170,000; the second is the excess over €250,000.

```catala
scope TaxaSolidariedade:
  definition imposto_quociente under condition quociente > limite_superior
    consequence equals money of (
      (decimal of (limite_superior - limite_inferior)) * taxa_inferior
      + (decimal of (quociente - limite_superior)) * taxa_superior
    )
```

#### N.º 3

3 - No caso de tributação conjunta, o procedimento referido nos números
anteriores aplica-se a metade do rendimento coletável, sendo a coleta obtida
pela multiplicação do resultado dessa operação por dois.

```catala
scope TaxaSolidariedade:
  definition quociente equals
    if tributacao_conjunta
    then money of ((decimal of rendimento_coletavel) / 2.0)
    else rendimento_coletavel

  definition imposto equals
    if tributacao_conjunta
    then money of ((decimal of imposto_quociente) * 2.0)
    else imposto_quociente
```

